capping and trimmed mean in BoardRecognizer, the board camera corners and the
per-map colour references in data/garrison_board_refs.json) are adapted from the
dev branch of ASP Assistant · Arknights (commit e4bee0d and later):
https://github.com/bingyunhe/asp-assistant-arknights
That code and data are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the
adapted files carry modification notices in their source headers. Enemy routes
